        "raw": "[quote=\"VisforYoshi\"]\n\n&nbsp;\n<div class=\"bb-quote\"><b>UXM266 wrote:</b><br /><blockquote class=\"bb-quote-body\">I think you can throw in Expatriette there too, no?\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nUnfortunatley, I don&#39;t think you can get Expat promo AND Legacy promo in the same game. Both require Baron blade to unlock, but I&#39;m pretty sure Legacy has to be in Wagner Mars Base, while Expat has to be in Rook City\n\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n\nYou are correct! Thanks!\n\n&nbsp;\n",
